title: The face followed on the rail has an eye, every assistant says its model (Claude Code's from its transcript, its helper's from its own, Codex's from what it tells), and the bar over the canvas names who is followed and stops it with a button
folders: rust-small
fixtures: claude-transcripts
limit: 70
expect-log: an assistant \(Claude Code\) is on the canvas
expect-log: an assistant \(Explore\) is on the canvas
expect-log: an assistant \(Claude Code\) works with claude-opus-5-5
expect-log: an assistant \(Explore\) works with claude-haiku-5-5
expect-log: an assistant \(Codex\) works with gpt-5.1-codex-max
forbid-log: script: agent needs

wait 3000
fit
wait 1000
agent {"source":"claude","hook":{"session_id":"s1","transcript_path":"{FIX}/claude-transcripts/s1.jsonl","hook_event_name":"UserPromptSubmit","cwd":"{FIX}/rust-small","prompt":"Make the steps faster"}}
wait 300
agent {"source":"claude","hook":{"session_id":"s1","transcript_path":"{FIX}/claude-transcripts/s1.jsonl","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","cwd":"{FIX}/rust-small","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"{FIX}/rust-small/src/main.rs","offset":1,"limit":4}}}
wait 300
agent {"source":"claude","hook":{"session_id":"s1","agent_id":"a7","agent_type":"Explore","transcript_path":"{FIX}/claude-transcripts/s1.jsonl","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","cwd":"{FIX}/rust-small","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"{FIX}/rust-small/src/steps.rs","offset":1,"limit":3}}}
wait 300
agent {"agent":"c1","name":"Codex","action":"read","path":"{FIX}/rust-small/src/util.rs","line":1,"lines":3,"model":"gpt-5.1-codex-max"}
wait 2500
mark three-with-models
wait 500
agent Make the steps faster
wait 2500
mark following-the-session
wait 500
ui move 26 718
wait 1500
mark tooltip-of-the-followed
wait 500
ui move 26 676
wait 1500
mark tooltip-of-another
wait 500
ui move 900 600
wait 500
ui click 1187 71
wait 1500
mark stopped-by-the-button
wait 500
quit
